From: Zurker <91011862+hershate@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 13:58:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Papo: zero-listener gate for EntityEffectTickEvent in
 MobEffectInstance.tickServer
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Every applied effect tick (poison 25t, wither 40t, regen 50t, beacon buffs
80t for every player in range) constructed an EntityEffectTickEvent plus a
CraftPotionEffectType conversion even with no plugin listening. The event has
its own HandlerList and no subclasses, and Cancellable defaults to false, so
with zero listeners callEvent() always returns true and control flow always
reaches applyEffectTick — same pattern as the EntityJumpEvent gate.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectInstance.java b/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectInstance.java
index 3bcfe2faca53e85a20bdbf847b25aef9c61e24f6..1b9ca5718b3c1823da6f43718f36eab1a3545da9 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectInstance.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectInstance.java
@@ -218,7 +218,11 @@ public class MobEffectInstance implements Comparable<MobEffectInstance> {
             return false;
         } else {
             int i = this.isInfiniteDuration() ? entity.tickCount : this.duration;
-            if (this.effect.value().shouldApplyEffectTickThisTick(i, this.amplifier) && new io.papermc.paper.event.entity.EntityEffectTickEvent(entity.getBukkitLivingEntity(), org.bukkit.craftbukkit.potion.CraftPotionEffectType.minecraftHolderToBukkit(this.effect), this.amplifier).callEvent() && !this.effect.value().applyEffectTick(level, entity, this.amplifier)) { // Paper - Add EntityEffectTickEvent
+            // Papo - skip EntityEffectTickEvent construction when there are no listeners: the
+            // event has its own HandlerList and no subclasses, Cancellable defaults to false, so
+            // with zero listeners callEvent() always returns true and control flow always reaches
+            // applyEffectTick. (Same pattern as the EntityJumpEvent gate.)
+            if (this.effect.value().shouldApplyEffectTickThisTick(i, this.amplifier) && (io.papermc.paper.event.entity.EntityEffectTickEvent.getHandlerList().getRegisteredListeners().length == 0 || new io.papermc.paper.event.entity.EntityEffectTickEvent(entity.getBukkitLivingEntity(), org.bukkit.craftbukkit.potion.CraftPotionEffectType.minecraftHolderToBukkit(this.effect), this.amplifier).callEvent()) && !this.effect.value().applyEffectTick(level, entity, this.amplifier)) { // Paper - Add EntityEffectTickEvent
                 return false;
             } else {
                 this.tickDownDuration();
